; Region master: only *include lines, no shots of its own. Three
; top-level blocks come from the three included files, so the
; multi-cave heuristic (topLevelBlockCount >= 2 and no own shots)
; fires on it. Each child fixes its own origin, so cavern solves the
; project as three independent caves.
*include "alpha.svx"
*include "bravo.svx"
*include "charlie.svx"
